  effects:
  - effect: 0
    maxActive: 12
    note: numbers that float up from a gate (FloatingNumbers pool)
  - effect: 1
    maxActive: 1
    note: the army counter pop in the HUD
  - effect: 2
    maxActive: 512
    note: ballistic deaths of the instanced swarms (assault); the obstacles' ring is smaller
  - effect: 3
    maxActive: 1
    note: the run camera's shake on a bad gate
  - effect: 4
    maxActive: 32
    note: stone and landing shadow of the cannon (pool)
  - effect: 5
    maxActive: 4
    note: tower floors crumbling (blocks per body)
